{"id":41628,"date":"2025-04-22T23:03:05","date_gmt":"2025-04-22T22:03:05","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=41628"},"modified":"2026-09-11T10:44:09","modified_gmt":"2026-09-11T09:44:09","slug":"maratona-de-paris","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-de-paris\/","title":{"rendered":"Maratona de Paris 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Maratona de Paris 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>50\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o hist\u00f3rica da ASICS Maratona de Paris 2027<\/strong> celebra meio s\u00e9culo de gl\u00f3ria desportiva numa das mais grandiosas e cobi\u00e7adas maratonas do planeta, agendada oficialmente para <strong>domingo, 4 de abril de 2027<\/strong>, na deslumbrante capital de <strong>Fran\u00e7a<\/strong>. Com partida monumental na lend\u00e1ria <strong>Avenue des Champs-\u00c9lys\u00e9es<\/strong> e chegada triunfal na <strong>Avenue Foch \/ Bois de Boulogne<\/strong>, o m\u00edtico percurso de <strong>42,195 km<\/strong> re\u00fane mais de 55.000 atletas de todo o mundo num cen\u00e1rio arquitet\u00f3nico incompar\u00e1vel com o selo World Athletics Elite Label.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pela <strong>A.S.O.<\/strong> em parceria com a <strong>ASICS<\/strong>, a edi\u00e7\u00e3o comemorativa introduz um inovador sistema oficial de <strong>sorteio de dorsais (tirage au sort \/ ballot)<\/strong> para garantir igualdade de oportunidades a todos os corredores, com inscri\u00e7\u00f5es a abrir em setembro e valor \u00fanico fixado em <strong>169 \u20ac<\/strong> (e dorsais solid\u00e1rios <em>Passerelle<\/em> a <strong>50 \u20ac<\/strong>). O tra\u00e7ado fluido abra\u00e7a \u00edcones eternos como a Pra\u00e7a da Conc\u00f3rdia, o Museu do Louvre, a \u00d3pera Garnier, o Castelo de Vincennes, as margens do Rio Sena e a Torre Eiffel, assegurando abastecimentos a cada 5 km, bengaleiro, medalha finisher comemorativa dos 50 anos e apoio popular caloroso.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">4 de Abril de 2027 \u00e0s 08:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Avenue des Champs-\u00c9lys\u00e9es, Paris, Fran\u00e7a, Fran\u00e7a<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Maratona (42,195 km)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">A.S.O. (Amaury Sport Organisation) e ASICS<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Cut-off)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">06:00<\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Maratona<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Marathon de Paris<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 4 Abr \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 08:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Dossard Passerelle:<\/strong> 50.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Crit\u00e9rios Eleg\u00edveis)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Tarifa Grand Public:<\/strong> 169.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Sorteio Oficial)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data oficial e o local de partida da ASICS Maratona de Paris 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 50\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o comemorativa da ASICS Maratona de Paris realiza-se oficialmente no domingo, 4 de abril de 2027, em Paris (Fran\u00e7a). A partida tem lugar na emblem\u00e1tica Avenue des Champs-\u00c9lys\u00e9es em dire\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e0 Pra\u00e7a da Conc\u00f3rdia, com blocos de partida organizados por ritmo das 08:00 at\u00e9 cerca das 10:30, culminando na apote\u00f3tica meta da Avenue Foch junto ao Bois de Boulogne.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona o novo sistema de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o por sorteio (tirage au sort) e quais os prazos?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A edi\u00e7\u00e3o de 2027 adota um sistema pioneiro de sorteio (ballot) para atribui\u00e7\u00e3o dos dorsais Grand Public. Os atletas inscrevem-se na plataforma oficial sem qualquer pagamento inicial durante o per\u00edodo de abertura em setembro. Os resultados come\u00e7am a ser divulgados a partir de 1 de outubro e os atletas selecionados disp\u00f5em de 72 horas para confirmar e pagar o seu dorsal oficial.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o pre\u00e7o oficial do dorsal para a Maratona de Paris 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o fixou a tarifa Grand Public \u00fanica de 169 \u20ac para a edi\u00e7\u00e3o de 2027, independentemente do momento de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no sorteio. Adicionalmente, existe o Dossard Passerelle a 50 \u20ac destinado a participantes que cumpram crit\u00e9rios espec\u00edficos de elegibilidade, bem como dorsais corporativos e op\u00e7\u00f5es de cariz solid\u00e1rio (Dossards Engag\u00e9s).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">\u00c9 poss\u00edvel realizar uma candidatura em equipa para o sorteio dos dorsais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim. O sistema permite criar equipas de 2 a 6 participantes no momento da inscri\u00e7\u00e3o para o sorteio. A equipa partilha o mesmo resultado de sele\u00e7\u00e3o: se um membro for contemplado no sorteio, todos os elementos da equipa obt\u00eam dorsal. No dia da prova, cada elemento corre a sua pr\u00f3pria corrida de forma individual e ao seu ritmo.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as exig\u00eancias m\u00e9dicas e a idade m\u00ednima para participar?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Para participar na ASICS Maratona de Paris 2027 \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio ter nascido at\u00e9 31 de dezembro de 2007 (completando 20 anos no ano da prova). Conforme a legisla\u00e7\u00e3o desportiva francesa em vigor, todos os participantes devem validar previamente o seu percurso de sa\u00fade atrav\u00e9s do Parcours Pr\u00e9vention Sant\u00e9 (PPS) digital oficial ou apresentar atestado m\u00e9dico desportivo para levantamento do dorsal.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org